 ],
 "id": "cases/evolve-jintrac-iter-15ma-rampup",
 "type": "fyo:ScenarioSpecification",
 "title": {
  "zh": "JINTRAC 15 MA L-mode case02 · ITER 电流爬升 13.9–66.5 s",
  "en": "JINTRAC 15 MA L-mode case02 - ITER current ramp-up, 13.9-66.5 s"
 },
 "note": {
  "zh": "★★这一档是这份文档里**唯一带完整定量轨迹**的算例，所以它值得收：八个时刻的 Te(0)/Ti(0)/ne(0)/Ip/q95/W_th 都是表里的数，不是从图上量的。配置里的初值取 **14.5 s 那一行**（Te0 9.39 keV · Ti0 3.86 keV · ne0 1.14e19 · Ip 3.61 MA · q95 13.18），这一点是源文档给的，不是本仓编的。★★但**本仓现在跑不了它**，缺的第一样就是主线本身：**电流爬升**。本仓的 `ip` 是处方值、只有台基读它；把 3.61 MA 到 15 MA 的爬升表示出来要靠波形驱动（`wave`），那一条还在浏览器循环里没沉。`fylite cases --plan` 会把这条连同 TGLF 闭包一起报出来。★源文档记着一件必须照抄的事：原始长跑在约 23 s 触发 TGLF/ZGESV 失败，重启路径推到 66.500010 s，而**这条重启路径不能反推为「从原始初态也一定能跑通」**。",
  "en": "★★This is the only case in the document that carries a COMPLETE QUANTITATIVE TRAJECTORY, which is why it is worth keeping: the eight rows of Te(0)/Ti(0)/ne(0)/Ip/q95/W_th are tabulated values, not numbers read off a plot. The config's initial state is the 14.5 s ROW (Te0 9.39 keV, Ti0 3.86 keV, ne0 1.14e19, Ip 3.61 MA, q95 13.18) -- the source's numbers, not this repository's. ★★But this repository CANNOT run it yet, and the first thing missing is the main line itself: the CURRENT RAMP. Here `ip` is prescribed and read only by the pedestal; representing 3.61 -> 15 MA needs the waveform driver (`wave`), which is still in the browser loop. `fylite cases --plan` reports that alongside the TGLF closure. ★The source records one thing that must be copied verbatim: the original long run hit a TGLF/ZGESV failure near 23 s, the restart path reached 66.500010 s, and THAT RESTART CANNOT BE EXTRAPOLATED to 'the original initial state would also have succeeded'."
 },
 "prescribed_task_kind": "fyo:PhysicsModelingTask",
 "prescribes_code": {
  "id": "code/evolve",
  "type": "spo:Code",
  "name": "fylite",
  "comment": "capability `evolve` of the fylite tool register (python/fylite/scenario/__init__.py TOOLS['evolve']); the parameter IRIs `code/evolve#<name>` are this capability's control vocabulary"
 },
 "about_discharge": {
  "type": "fyo:Discharge",
  "performed_on": {
   "type": "fyo:Tokamak",
   "title": {
    "en": "ITER"
   }
  }
 },
 "inputs": [
  {
   "type": "spo:PortBinding",
   "binds_port": {
    "type": "spo:PortDefinition",
    "port_name": "reference",
    "port_direction": "input"
   },
   "bound_to": {
    "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
    "title": {
     "zh": "参考值（逐字抄录，待比较记录）",
     "en": "Reference values (transcribed verbatim; awaiting a comparison record)"
    },
    "comment": [
     "源文档 105 个 JSP 时刻里列出的八个，**逐字抄录**。★这是一条**累积的检查点历史**，不是一次不间断的原始作业——源文档自己写明「accumulated checkpoint history, not one uninterrupted original job」，原始长跑在约 23 s 触发 TGLF/ZGESV 失败，后半段来自重启分支（作业 101851 / 101864）。★所以它可以当**轨迹参考**，不可以当「一次跑通的答案」。",
     "| JETTO time | Te(0) | Ti(0) | ne(0) | Ip | q95 | W_thermal |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 14.5 s | 9.39 keV | 3.86 keV | 1.14e19 m^-3 | 3.61 MA | 13.18 | 5.08 MJ |\n| 20.5 s | 5.94 keV | 5.40 keV | 2.81e19 m^-3 | 4.97 MA | 9.19 | 14.27 MJ |\n| 23.0 s | 6.37 keV | 5.63 keV | 3.07e19 m^-3 | 5.53 MA | 8.09 | 16.23 MJ |\n| 25.0 s | 6.22 keV | 5.53 keV | 3.30e19 m^-3 | 5.98 MA | 7.26 | 17.47 MJ |\n| 40.0 s | 6.85 keV | 6.09 keV | 4.64e19 m^-3 | 9.36 MA | 4.49 | 27.60 MJ |\n| 50.0 s | 7.67 keV | 6.81 keV | 5.02e19 m^-3 | 11.62 MA | 3.60 | 33.37 MJ |\n| 60.0 s | 7.54 keV | 7.00 keV | 5.79e19 m^-3 | 13.87 MA | 3.01 | 42.01 MJ |\n| 66.5 s | 8.06 keV | 7.59 keV | 5.90e19 m^-3 | 15.00 MA | 2.77 | 47.67 MJ |\n| final_snapshot_66_5s | {'separatrix_J38_J52_Te': '133.6 / 131.3 eV', 'outer_inner_target_Te': '1.28 / 1.39 eV', 'outer_inner_target_ne': '1.64 / 1.68e20 cm^-3', 'Te_drop_sep_to_target': 'x105 / x94', 'ne_rise_sep_to_target': 'x9.8 / x10.0', 'final_JETTO_time': '66.500010 s'} |"
    ]
   }
  }
 ],
 "caveat": {
  "zh": [
   "波形驱动（`wave`）：Ip 从 3.61 MA 爬到 15.00 MA 是这一档的**主线**，而本仓的 `ip` 是处方值、只有台基读它 —— 爬升要靠波形驱动，那一条还没沉",
   "TGLF 湍流闭包（`closure = 3`）：源文档的反常输运通量由 TGLF 按本地状态算",
   "SANCO 杂质输运与辐射：本仓只有规定浓度的单一杂质，没有杂质**输运**"
  ],
  "en": [
   "The waveform driver (`wave`): Ip ramping 3.61 -> 15.00 MA is this case's MAIN LINE, and this repository's `ip` is prescribed and read only by the pedestal -- a ramp needs the waveform driver, which is not sunk yet",
   "The TGLF turbulent closure (`closure = 3`): the source's anomalous fluxes are TGLF's, computed from the local plasma state",
   "SANCO impurity transport and radiation: this repository carries one impurity at a PRESCRIBED concentration and no impurity TRANSPORT"
  ]
 },
 "generated_by_process": {
  "type": "spo:PlannedProcess",
  "note": {
   "zh": "由源文档人工转录为本规格",
   "en": "transcribed by hand from the source document into this specification"
  },
  "has_input": [
